#. module: pb_training
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_training.step_training_day1
msgid "Put them on their first courses"
msgstr "Daftarkan ke kursus pertama"

#. module: pb_training
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_training.step_training_day1
msgid "Runs itself on the joining day: the courses every new joiner has to do are added to their own training page, with a date to finish them by. If no day-one courses have been set up yet, the step simply says so."
msgstr "Berjalan otomatis di hari bergabung: kursus yang wajib bagi setiap karyawan baru ditambahkan ke halaman pelatihan mereka, dengan batas waktu penyelesaian. Jika belum ada kursus hari pertama yang disiapkan, langkah ini cukup menyebutkannya."
